the machines themselves, to study.

295
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:25,370
So who writes the fourth line?

296
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,150
The labs, which decide

297
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:28,330
what gets built.

298
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,050
Governments, which decide

299
00:08:30,090 --> 00:08:31,320
what gets tested.

300
00:08:31,530 --> 00:08:33,050
And voters, who choose

301
00:08:33,090 --> 00:08:34,460
who writes the rules.

302
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,450
That last one is you.

303
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:38,580
And if the machine

304
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,030
does the inventing,

305
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,860
what else is left for us?

306
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:44,520
This spring, another of those math

307
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,860
problems fell, after

308
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,470
about 60 years.

309
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,940
Not to a professor.

310
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,240
To Liam Price, 23,

311
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,200
with no advanced

312
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,670
training in mathematics.

313
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,860
He typed a single

314
00:08:54,900 --> 00:08:56,630
question into ChatGPT,

315
00:08:56,670 --> 00:08:58,440
and posted the answer online.

316
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,460
Then two mathematicians checked

317
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:02,160
the proof and made it shorter.

318
00:09:02,490 --> 00:09:04,310
One of them was Terence Tao.

319
00:09:04,550 --> 00:09:06,770
Today, Price is his co-author.

320
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,020
The machine found the way.

321
00:09:09,270 --> 00:09:11,080
A person chose the question.

322
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,890
And people checked the answer.

323
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:15,630
Maybe that is what stays with us.

324
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:17,070
Not the answers.

325
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:18,200
The questions.

326
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:19,730
And the direction.

327
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,880
So what will A.G.I.

328
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,190
invent for you?

329
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:25,270
Three lines on your list.

330
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:26,750
Not in your home yet.

331
00:09:26,790 --> 00:09:27,790
But begun.

332
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,000
The fourth line is still empty.

333
00:09:30,090 --> 00:09:31,750
And it is ours to write.

334
00:09:32,070 --> 00:09:32,970
The final human

335
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:34,250
invention is the one

336
00:09:34,290 --> 00:09:36,160
that invents everything else.

337
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,140
And the last thing

338
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:38,030
we have to invent

339
00:09:38,070 --> 00:09:40,470
ourselves is how to steer it.

340
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:43,930
That line needs many hands.

341
00:09:44,530 --> 00:09:45,630
This channel exists

342
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,970
for one reason:

343
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,000
so that the arrival

344
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,200
of superintelligence

345
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,990
goes well for everybody.

346
00:09:51,250 --> 00:09:52,250
Want that too?

347
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:53,580
Then subscribe.

